<title>USA: Petrolite launches chemical subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Petrolite launches chemical subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrolite Corp said Monday its Polymers Division created a new business unit called New Phase Technologies.</p>
<p>Petrolite said the new unit will provide specialty chemical ingredients for personal care products, with an emphasis on assisting in the development of new consumer products.</p>
<p>New Phase Technologies will be based in New Jersey. Petrolite added it will soon announced a location that will incude administrative offices and a formulation laboratory.</p>
<p>Shares of Petrolite, a specialty chemical company, were up 3/4 Monday afternoon at 45-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
